  "body": "Beautifully refurbished and located in the prestigious Macleans College school zone, this immaculately presented two-level residence brings together generous family living, contemporary comfort, and enjoys expansive water views stretching across the Hauraki Gulf towards Motuihe and Waiheke Islands.\r\n\r\nFully reclad and enhanced with double-glazed windows, this special property boasts light-filled interiors and a free-flowing floor plan which creates an inviting yet practical sense of space.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a stylish contemporary kitchen, which seamlessly connects to generous formal and informal living areas providing flexibility for all ages. The main living spaces lead to the deck, where an impressive coastal outlook provides a spectacular backdrop for morning coffees, evening drinks or entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nThis easy lock up and leave home offers four generous double bedrooms and two bathrooms plus a powder room. On the ground level a further living area gives access to the private outdoors, creating another peaceful space to relax while providing room for children and pets to go outside.\r\n\r\nInternal-access garaging and generous off-street parking add everyday practicality, while the location is close to beaches, cafes, parks, a golf course and other local amenities. \r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate zoning for Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and the highly regarded Macleans College.\r\n\r\nCombining views, modern upgrades and an enviable Peninsula location, this is an address which makes everyday living effortless.\r\n\r\nCome home, unwind and enjoy this convenient coastal lifestyle - it is just what you have been waiting for.\r\n\r\nAuction (unless sold prior) at 2pm, Tuesday 13 October 2026",
